==Restrictions==
Max # of Deployable Cats: 1

==Battleground==
*1 [[Chickful A]] spawns as the boss after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*1 [[Le'noir]] spawns as the boss after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*1 [[Metal One Horn]] spawns as the boss.
*Infinite [[Assassin Bear]]s spawn after 900 seconds<sup>27,000f</sup>, delay 900 seconds<sup>27,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use any [[:Category:Critical Hit Cats|Critical Hitter]] to take care of the Metal One Horn. For Le'noir, use [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]], [[Sanada Yukimura (Uber Rare Cat)|Wargod Yukimura]] and/or [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Maglev Cat]] paired with the default [[Cat Cannon]] to rush him down, or use any other [[:Category:Anti-Dark Cats|anti-Dark cat]] that has decent health and damage to slowly finish him. For Chickful A, use Awakened Bahamut Cat, Maglev Cat and/or [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Butterfly Cat]].

